  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Also at 3rd level, when you hit with a ranged weapon attack, you can choose to make it explosive. It deals an extra 1d6 damage of your choice of the weapon you are using, fire, or thunder. You can deal this damage once per turn.</p>\n<p>In addition, you can choose to make it so all creatures within 5 ft of the attack must make a Dexterity saving throw against your Creation Save DC. On a failure, they also take the damage from the attack, half on a success.</p>",
